  "description": "\"Is touching men's bodies a hobby of yours, Hong Eun-jo?\"  \nIn a hotel suite, Eun-jo was inadvertently fondling a man's body.    \nAnd not just any man—her subordinate, her time-limited fake lover, and the man who was soon to become the ultimate boss of the company.   \n\n\"What are you talking about! I was just wiping off the wine.\"  \n\"While groping my chest as a bonus?\"  \n\"G-Groping?\" \n\nLooking up with a flabbergasted expression, Eun-jo heard Tae-hwi murmur lowly,\n\"You did it last time, too.\"   \n\"Th-That was because I spilled tomato juice...\"  \n\"You used that as an excuse to touch me quite well, though.\" \n\nAt his brazen remark, Eun-jo's jaw dropped.\n\n\"What are you doing? The wine is still flowing.\"\n\nEun-jo's gaze drifted downward from his chest.\nThe red wine spilled on his white shirt was soaking into his stomach and spreading down to his pants.   \nStaring trance-like at the dripping wine, Eun-jo snapped back to reality and reminded herself of their contract condition:   \n'Let's do everything except love.'  \nAnd once again, she resolved herself:\nTo successfully bring this romance to an end.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14473201)",
